        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "called unto Moses, and spake unto him out of the tabernacle of the congregation, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak unto the children of Israel, and say unto them, If any man of you bring an offering unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ye shall bring your offering of the cattle,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the herd, and of the flock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If his offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a burnt sacrifice of the herd, let him offer a male without blemish: he shall offer it of his own voluntary will at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall put his hand upon the head of the burnt offering; and it shall be accepted for him to make atonement for him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall kill the bullock before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and the priests, Aaron's sons, shall bring the blood, and sprinkle the blood round about upon the altar that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the door of the tabernacle of the congregation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall flay the burnt offering, and cut it into his pieces.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Aaron the priest shall put fire upon the altar, and lay the wood in order upon the fire:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priests, Aaron's sons, shall lay the parts, the head, and the fat, in order upon the wood that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on the fire which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the altar:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But his inwards and his legs shall he wash in water: and the priest shall burn all on the altar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a burnt sacrifice, an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And if his offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the flocks,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "namely",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", of the sheep, or of the goats, for a burnt sacrifice; he shall bring it a male without blemish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall kill it on the side of the altar northward before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and the priests, Aaron's sons, shall sprinkle his blood round about upon the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall cut it into his pieces, with his head and his fat: and the priest shall lay them in order on the wood that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on the fire which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the altar:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he shall wash the inwards and the legs with water: and the priest shall bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all, and burn",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the altar: it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a burnt sacrifice, an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And if the burnt sacrifice for his offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of fowls, then he shall bring his offering of turtledoves, or of young pigeons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall bring it unto the altar, and wring off his head, and burn",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.1.15",
